msgstr "Platzierung"

#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/assembly/ballot/_ballot_tallied.tmpl:10
#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/assembly/ballot/_ballot_voting.tmpl:5
#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/assembly/ballot/_ballot_voting.tmpl:22
#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/assembly/ballot/_ballot_voting.tmpl:64
#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/assembly/ballot/_ballot_voting.tmpl:321
